rvested rather than grown.","It has missed earnings estimates by 47.1% on average.","Analysts expect 66.7% long-term annual earnings growth."],"own":["Insiders own 11.6%, meaningful skin in the game, and institutions hold 31%.","Insiders have only bought over the past year (6 purchases, net $351K bought)."],"people":["With about 243 employees, each generates about $1.1M of revenue, 2.1x the Financial Services median.","That works out to $72K of free cash flow per employee.","CEO pay is $1.0M (1x revenue per employee), and compensation governance scores well (3/10, lower is better)."]},"profile":{"v":"WATCH","conv":45,"head":"Watch: ROE 6.2% vs cost of equity 9.4%.","pros":["Trades 34% below fair value of $6.21","2 analysts' mean target $5.25 (+27%)","Insiders net buyers ($351K over 12 months)"],"cons":["ROE 6.2% vs cost of equity 9.4%","P/E 18.8x vs sector 12.2x","EV/EBITDA 18.0x vs sector 10.9x","12-1 month momentum -39%","Thinly traded ($426K a day)"],"flags":[],"need":["the model rates it HOLD","it earns less than its cost of capital","too few checks pass (conviction 45)"],"buy_below":5.28,"vc":{"base":6.21,"base_src":"dcf","bear":4.65,"bull":8.53,"alt_median":1.98,"n_alt":2,"gap":3.3669,"dispersion":0.5069,"level":"LOW","why":["models disagree (51% dispersion)","DCF is 337% above the other models' median ($1.98)"]},"med":{"pe":12.155,"ev_ebitda":10.862,"pfcf":12.9041,"pb":1.3934,"roic":0.116,"gross_margin":0.4181,"fcf_margin":0.2507,"div_yield":0.0265}},"ticker":"CIA","date":"2026-11-06"}